+      context,
+      `the asserted member ${expression.name} read from ${emitType(sourceType, context)} as ${emitType(targetType, context)} can be absent at runtime, and its type ${memberStorage} has no absent state: declare the member optional, or make its type a declared opaque host-handle absence carrier`,
